  "statement": "(x y z k : ℝ) (hx : 0 < x ∧ 0 < y ∧ 0 < z) (hy : k > 1) : (x + y + z) * (1 / x + 1 / y + 1 / z) = 9 + 8 / (k ^ 2 - 1) → (2 * (k + 1) ^ 3 + (k - 1) ^ 3) / ((k - 1) * (k + 1) ^ 2) ≤ (x ^ 3 + y ^ 3 + z ^ 3) / (x * y * z) ∧ (x ^ 3 + y ^ 3 + z ^ 3) / (x * y * z) ≤ (2 * (k - 1) ^ 3 + (k + 1) ^ 3) / ((k + 1) * (k - 1) ^ 2)",
  "closed": "∀ (x y z k : ℝ) (hx : 0 < x ∧ 0 < y ∧ 0 < z) (hy : k > 1), (x + y + z) * (1 / x + 1 / y + 1 / z) = 9 + 8 / (k ^ 2 - 1) → (2 * (k + 1) ^ 3 + (k - 1) ^ 3) / ((k - 1) * (k + 1) ^ 2) ≤ (x ^ 3 + y ^ 3 + z ^ 3) / (x * y * z) ∧ (x ^ 3 + y ^ 3 + z ^ 3) / (x * y * z) ≤ (2 * (k - 1) ^ 3 + (k + 1) ^ 3) / ((k + 1) * (k - 1) ^ 2)",
  "informal": "If $x, y$ and $z$ are positive real number and $k > 1$ such that $(x+y+z)\\left ( \\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{z} \\right )=9+\\frac{8}{k^2-1},$ then $\\frac{2(k+1)^3+(k-1)^3}{(k-1)(k+1)^2} \\leqslant \\frac{x^3+y^3+z^3}{xyz} \\leqslant \\frac{2(k-1)^3+(k+1)^3}{(k+1)(k-1)^2}.$",
